#: ../../library/omv.display.rgbdisplay.rst:4
msgid "class RGBDisplay -- RGB Display Driver"
msgstr "kelas RGBDisplay -- Driver Tampilan RGB"

#: ../../library/omv.display.rgbdisplay.rst:6
msgid ""
"The :class:`RGBDisplay` class drives 24-bit parallel RGB LCDs through the "
"STM32 LTDC (LCD-TFT) controller. The LTDC streams pixels directly out of an "
"SDRAM-backed framebuffer at the chosen pixel clock, so high refresh rates "
"(up to 120 Hz) are possible without CPU involvement."
msgstr ""
"Kelas :class:`RGBDisplay` menggerakkan LCD RGB paralel 24-bit melalui "
"kontroler STM32 LTDC (LCD-TFT). LTDC mengalirkan piksel langsung dari buffer"
" bingkai berbasis SDRAM pada clock piksel yang dipilih, sehingga refresh "
"rate tinggi (hingga 120 Hz) dimungkinkan tanpa keterlibatan CPU."

#: ../../library/omv.display.rgbdisplay.rst:11
msgid ""
"On the OpenMV Cam Pure Thermal the same 24-bit parallel bus also feeds an "
"on-board TFP410 HDMI encoder, so its HDMI output is driven through this "
"class too -- use ``display_on=False`` to blank the on-board LCD while still "
"clocking pixels to the encoder."
msgstr ""
"Pada OpenMV Cam Pure Thermal, bus paralel 24-bit yang sama juga memberi "
"makan encoder HDMI TFP410 yang terpasang di board, sehingga output HDMI-nya "
"juga dikendalikan melalui kelas ini -- gunakan ``display_on=False`` untuk "
"memadamkan LCD on-board sambil tetap mengalirkan piksel ke encoder."

#: ../../library/omv.display.rgbdisplay.rst:16
msgid ""
"Panel resolution is selected through ``framesize`` using the constants "
"defined in the :mod:`display` module (``QVGA``, ``VGA``, ``WVGA``, ``HD``, "
"``FHD``, ...). Panel-specific initialisation sequences are plugged in via "
"the ``controller`` keyword argument (for example :class:`ST7701` for "
"ST7701-based panels). Backlight brightness is driven as a simple GPIO by "
"default, or by :class:`DACBacklight` / :class:`PWMBacklight` if one is "
"passed as ``backlight``."
msgstr ""
"Resolusi panel dipilih melalui ``framesize`` menggunakan konstanta yang "
"didefinisikan di modul :mod:`display` (\\ ``QVGA``\\ , ``VGA``\\ , "
"``WVGA``\\ , ``HD``\\ , ``FHD``\\ , ...). Urutan inisialisasi spesifik panel"
" disisipkan melalui argumen kata kunci ``controller`` (misalnya "
":class:`ST7701` untuk panel berbasis ST7701). Kecerahan backlight "
"dikendalikan sebagai GPIO sederhana secara default, atau oleh "
":class:`DACBacklight` / :class:`PWMBacklight` jika salah satunya diteruskan "
"sebagai ``backlight``\\ ."

#: ../../library/omv.display.rgbdisplay.rst:24
msgid ""
"Frames are presented by calling :meth:`write` with an :class:`image.Image`. "
"The driver handles RGB conversion, scaling, ROI, palette and orientation "
"transforms internally."
msgstr ""
"Bingkai ditampilkan dengan memanggil :meth:`write` dengan sebuah "
":class:`image.Image`\\ . Driver menangani konversi RGB, penskalaan, ROI, "
"palet, dan transformasi orientasi secara internal."

#: ../../library/omv.display.rgbdisplay.rst:28
msgid "Example -- mirror the camera onto a 480x272 panel at 60 Hz::"
msgstr "Contoh -- mencerminkan kamera ke panel 480x272 pada 60 Hz::"

#: ../../library/omv.display.rgbdisplay.rst:45
msgid "Constructors"
msgstr "Konstruktor"

#: ../../library/omv.display.rgbdisplay.rst:49
msgid ""
"``framesize`` One of the standard supported resolutions (see the `display` "
"module constants)."
msgstr ""
"``framesize`` Salah satu resolusi standar yang didukung (lihat konstanta "
"modul `display`\\ )."

#: ../../library/omv.display.rgbdisplay.rst:51
msgid ""
"``refresh`` Sets the screen refresh rate in hertz (30-120). This controls "
"the RGB LCD pixel clock."
msgstr ""
"``refresh`` Mengatur refresh rate layar dalam hertz (30-120). Ini mengontrol"
" clock piksel LCD RGB."

#: ../../library/omv.display.rgbdisplay.rst:53
msgid ""
"``display_on`` Enables the local LCD output. Pass ``False`` on the OpenMV "
"Cam Pure Thermal, whose 24-bit parallel bus drives both the on-board LCD and"
" the TFP410 HDMI encoder -- this keeps the on-board LCD blanked while still "
"feeding the HDMI encoder. On other OpenMV Cams there is no shared sink and "
"this can be left at its default."
msgstr ""
"``display_on`` Mengaktifkan output LCD lokal. Oper ``False`` pada OpenMV Cam"
" Pure Thermal, yang bus paralel 24-bit-nya menggerakkan baik LCD on-board "
"maupun encoder HDMI TFP410 -- ini menjaga LCD on-board tetap kosong sambil "
"tetap memberi makan encoder HDMI. Pada OpenMV Cam lainnya tidak ada sink "
"bersama dan ini dapat dibiarkan pada nilai defaultnya."

#: ../../library/omv.display.rgbdisplay.rst:59
msgid ""
"``triple_buffer`` If ``True``, makes updates to the screen non-blocking at "
"the cost of 3x the display size in RAM."
msgstr ""
"``triple_buffer`` Jika ``True``\\ , membuat pembaruan layar menjadi non-"
"blocking dengan biaya 3x ukuran tampilan dalam RAM."

#: ../../library/omv.display.rgbdisplay.rst:62
msgid "``portrait`` Swaps the framesize width and height."
msgstr "``portrait`` Menukar lebar dan tinggi framesize."

#: ../../library/omv.display.rgbdisplay.rst:64
msgid ""
"``controller`` Pass a controller chip class instance to initialize it along "
"with the display."
msgstr ""
"``controller`` Oper instans kelas chip kontroler untuk menginisialisasinya "
"bersama tampilan."

#: ../../library/omv.display.rgbdisplay.rst:66
msgid ""
"``backlight`` Pass a backlight controller module instance to use. By default"
" the backlight will be controlled via a GPIO pin."
msgstr ""
"``backlight`` Oper instans modul kontroler backlight yang akan digunakan. "
"Secara default backlight akan dikendalikan melalui pin GPIO."

#: ../../library/omv.display.rgbdisplay.rst:71
msgid ""
"Releases the I/O pins and RAM used by the class. This is called "
"automatically on destruction."
msgstr ""
"Melepaskan pin I/O dan RAM yang digunakan oleh kelas. Ini dipanggil secara "
"otomatis saat penghancuran objek."

#: ../../library/omv.display.rgbdisplay.rst:75
msgid "Returns the width of the screen."
msgstr "Mengembalikan lebar layar."

#: ../../library/omv.display.rgbdisplay.rst:79
msgid "Returns the height of the screen."
msgstr "Mengembalikan tinggi layar."

#: ../../library/omv.display.rgbdisplay.rst:83
msgid "Returns whether triple buffering is enabled."
msgstr "Mengembalikan apakah triple buffering diaktifkan."

#: ../../library/omv.display.rgbdisplay.rst:87
msgid "Returns whether the red and blue channels are swapped."
msgstr "Mengembalikan apakah saluran merah dan biru ditukar."

#: ../../library/omv.display.rgbdisplay.rst:91
msgid "Returns whether the RGB565 pixel bytes are swapped on output."
msgstr "Mengembalikan apakah byte piksel RGB565 ditukar pada output."

#: ../../library/omv.display.rgbdisplay.rst:95
msgid "Returns the framesize constant the display was configured with."
msgstr "Mengembalikan konstanta framesize yang dikonfigurasi untuk tampilan."

#: ../../library/omv.display.rgbdisplay.rst:99
msgid "Returns the refresh rate."
msgstr "Mengembalikan refresh rate."

#: ../../library/omv.display.rgbdisplay.rst:103
msgid "Clears the LCD screen to black."
msgstr "Membersihkan layar LCD menjadi hitam."

#: ../../library/omv.display.rgbdisplay.rst:105
msgid ""
"``display_off`` if ``True``, turns off the display logic instead of clearing"
" the framebuffer to black. You should also turn off the backlight after this"
" to ensure the screen goes black, as many displays are white when only the "
"backlight is on."
msgstr ""
"``display_off`` jika ``True``\\ , mematikan logika tampilan alih-alih "
"membersihkan buffer bingkai menjadi hitam. Anda juga harus mematikan "
"backlight setelahnya untuk memastikan layar menjadi hitam, karena banyak "
"tampilan berwarna putih ketika hanya backlight yang menyala."

#: ../../library/omv.display.rgbdisplay.rst:111
msgid ""
"Sets the LCD backlight dimming value, from 0 (off) to 100 (on). Pass no "
"arguments to get the current backlight value."
msgstr ""
"Mengatur nilai redupan backlight LCD, dari 0 (mati) hingga 100 (menyala). "
"Oper tanpa argumen untuk mendapatkan nilai backlight saat ini."

#: ../../library/omv.display.rgbdisplay.rst:114
msgid ""
"Unless a `DACBacklight` or `PWMBacklight` controller was passed to the "
"constructor, the backlight is controlled as a GPIO pin and will only go from"
" 0 (off) to non-zero (on)."
msgstr ""
"Kecuali kontroler `DACBacklight` atau `PWMBacklight` diteruskan ke "
"konstruktor, backlight dikendalikan sebagai pin GPIO dan hanya akan "
"berpindah dari 0 (mati) ke non-nol (menyala)."

#: ../../library/omv.display.rgbdisplay.rst:119
msgid ""
"Displays an ``image`` whose top-left corner starts at location ``x``, ``y``."
" A path string may also be passed instead of an image object to "
"automatically load the image from disk."
msgstr ""
"Menampilkan ``image`` yang sudut kiri atasnya dimulai pada lokasi ``x``\\ , "
"``y``\\ . String path juga dapat diteruskan alih-alih objek citra untuk "
"memuat citra secara otomatis dari disk."

#: ../../library/omv.display.rgbdisplay.rst:122
msgid ""
"``x_scale`` controls how much the displayed image is scaled by in the x "
"direction. If this value is negative the image will be flipped horizontally."
" If ``y_scale`` is not specified it will match ``x_scale`` to maintain the "
"aspect ratio."
msgstr ""
"``x_scale`` mengontrol seberapa besar citra yang ditampilkan diskalakan "
"dalam arah x. Jika nilai ini negatif, citra akan dibalik secara horizontal. "
"Jika ``y_scale`` tidak ditentukan, nilainya akan mengikuti ``x_scale`` untuk"
" mempertahankan rasio aspek."

#: ../../library/omv.display.rgbdisplay.rst:126
msgid ""
"``y_scale`` controls how much the displayed image is scaled by in the y "
"direction. If this value is negative the image will be flipped vertically "
"(requires triple buffering). If ``x_scale`` is not specified it will match "
"``y_scale`` to maintain the aspect ratio."
msgstr ""
"``y_scale`` mengontrol seberapa besar citra yang ditampilkan diskalakan "
"dalam arah y. Jika nilai ini negatif, citra akan dibalik secara vertikal "
"(memerlukan triple buffering). Jika ``x_scale`` tidak ditentukan, nilainya "
"akan mengikuti ``y_scale`` untuk mempertahankan rasio aspek."

#: ../../library/omv.display.rgbdisplay.rst:130
msgid ""
"``roi`` is the region-of-interest rectangle tuple ``(x, y, w, h)`` of the "
"image to display."
msgstr ""
"``roi`` adalah tuple persegi panjang wilayah yang diminati ``(x, y, w, h)`` "
"dari citra yang akan ditampilkan."

#: ../../library/omv.display.rgbdisplay.rst:132
msgid ""
"``rgb_channel`` is the RGB channel (0=R, 1=G, 2=B) to extract from an RGB565"
" image and render in grayscale. ``-1`` disables channel extraction."
msgstr ""
"``rgb_channel`` adalah saluran RGB (0=R, 1=G, 2=B) yang diekstrak dari citra"
" RGB565 dan dirender dalam skala abu-abu. ``-1`` menonaktifkan ekstraksi "
"saluran."

#: ../../library/omv.display.rgbdisplay.rst:135
msgid ""
"``alpha`` controls how opaque the image is, from 0 (fully transparent / "
"black) to 255 (opaque)."
msgstr ""
"``alpha`` mengontrol seberapa buram citra, dari 0 (sepenuhnya transparan / "
"hitam) hingga 255 (buram)."

#: ../../library/omv.display.rgbdisplay.rst:137
msgid ""
"``color_palette`` an RGB565 image of 256 pixels total used as a color lookup"
" table on the grayscale value of the input image. Applied after "
"``rgb_channel`` extraction. May also be a palette enum (e.g. "
"`image.PALETTE_RAINBOW`)."
msgstr ""
"``color_palette`` sebuah citra RGB565 berisi 256 piksel yang digunakan "
"sebagai tabel pencarian warna pada nilai skala abu-abu dari citra input. "
"Diterapkan setelah ekstraksi ``rgb_channel``\\ . Bisa juga berupa enum palet"
" (mis. `image.PALETTE_RAINBOW`\\ )."

#: ../../library/omv.display.rgbdisplay.rst:141
msgid ""
"``alpha_palette`` a GRAYSCALE image of 256 pixels total used as a per-pixel "
"alpha lookup table on the grayscale value of the input image. Applied after "
"``rgb_channel`` extraction."
msgstr ""
"``alpha_palette`` sebuah citra GRAYSCALE berisi 256 piksel yang digunakan "
"sebagai tabel pencarian alpha per piksel pada nilai skala abu-abu dari citra"
" input. Diterapkan setelah ekstraksi ``rgb_channel``\\ ."

#: ../../library/omv.display.rgbdisplay.rst:144
msgid "``hint`` is a logical OR of the flags:"
msgstr "``hint`` adalah OR logika dari flag-flag:"

#: ../../library/omv.display.rgbdisplay.rst:146
msgid ""
"`image.AREA`: Use area scaling when downscaling instead of nearest neighbor."
msgstr ""
"`image.AREA`\\ : Gunakan penskalaan area saat memperkecil alih-alih tetangga"
" terdekat."

#: ../../library/omv.display.rgbdisplay.rst:147
msgid "`image.BILINEAR`: Use bilinear scaling instead of nearest neighbor."
msgstr ""
"`image.BILINEAR`\\ : Gunakan penskalaan bilinear alih-alih tetangga "
"terdekat."

#: ../../library/omv.display.rgbdisplay.rst:148
msgid "`image.BICUBIC`: Use bicubic scaling instead of nearest neighbor."
msgstr ""
"`image.BICUBIC`\\ : Gunakan penskalaan bicubic alih-alih tetangga terdekat."

#: ../../library/omv.display.rgbdisplay.rst:149
msgid ""
"`image.CENTER`: Center the image on the display (applied after scaling)."
msgstr ""
"`image.CENTER`\\ : Pusatkan citra pada tampilan (diterapkan setelah "
"penskalaan)."

#: ../../library/omv.display.rgbdisplay.rst:150
msgid "`image.HMIRROR`: Horizontally mirror the image."
msgstr "`image.HMIRROR`\\ : Cerminkan citra secara horizontal."

#: ../../library/omv.display.rgbdisplay.rst:151
msgid "`image.VFLIP`: Vertically flip the image."
msgstr "`image.VFLIP`\\ : Balik citra secara vertikal."

#: ../../library/omv.display.rgbdisplay.rst:152
msgid "`image.TRANSPOSE`: Transpose the image (swap x/y)."
msgstr "`image.TRANSPOSE`\\ : Transpose citra (tukar x/y)."

#: ../../library/omv.display.rgbdisplay.rst:153
msgid ""
"`image.EXTRACT_RGB_CHANNEL_FIRST`: Do ``rgb_channel`` extraction before "
"scaling."
msgstr ""
"`image.EXTRACT_RGB_CHANNEL_FIRST`\\ : Lakukan ekstraksi ``rgb_channel`` "
"sebelum penskalaan."

#: ../../library/omv.display.rgbdisplay.rst:154
msgid ""
"`image.APPLY_COLOR_PALETTE_FIRST`: Apply ``color_palette`` before scaling."
msgstr ""
"`image.APPLY_COLOR_PALETTE_FIRST`\\ : Terapkan ``color_palette`` sebelum "
"penskalaan."

#: ../../library/omv.display.rgbdisplay.rst:155
msgid "`image.SCALE_ASPECT_KEEP`: Scale the image to fit inside the display."
msgstr ""
"`image.SCALE_ASPECT_KEEP`\\ : Skalakan citra agar muat di dalam tampilan."

#: ../../library/omv.display.rgbdisplay.rst:156
msgid ""
"`image.SCALE_ASPECT_EXPAND`: Scale the image to fill the display (cropping)."
msgstr ""
"`image.SCALE_ASPECT_EXPAND`\\ : Skalakan citra untuk mengisi tampilan "
"(dengan pemotongan)."

#: ../../library/omv.display.rgbdisplay.rst:157
msgid ""
"`image.SCALE_ASPECT_IGNORE`: Scale the image to fill the display "
"(stretching)."
msgstr ""
"`image.SCALE_ASPECT_IGNORE`\\ : Skalakan citra untuk mengisi tampilan "
"(dengan peregangan)."

#: ../../library/omv.display.rgbdisplay.rst:158
msgid "`image.ROTATE_90`: Rotate by 90 degrees (``VFLIP | TRANSPOSE``)."
msgstr "`image.ROTATE_90`\\ : Putar 90 derajat (\\ ``VFLIP | TRANSPOSE``\\ )."

#: ../../library/omv.display.rgbdisplay.rst:159
msgid "`image.ROTATE_180`: Rotate by 180 degrees (``HMIRROR | VFLIP``)."
msgstr "`image.ROTATE_180`\\ : Putar 180 derajat (\\ ``HMIRROR | VFLIP``\\ )."

#: ../../library/omv.display.rgbdisplay.rst:160
msgid "`image.ROTATE_270`: Rotate by 270 degrees (``HMIRROR | TRANSPOSE``)."
msgstr "`image.ROTATE_270`\\ : Putar 270 derajat (\\ ``HMIRROR | TRANSPOSE``\\ )."
